    "text": "Let A be a \\(3 \\times 4\\) matrix and B a \\(4 \\times 5\\) matrix. Which of the following statements are true?\n(i) \\(\\operatorname{rank}(AB) \\le 3\\).\n(ii) \\(\\operatorname{rank}(A) \\le \\operatorname{rank}(B)\\).",
