    "text": "Find the number \\(k\\) for which the matrix\n\\[ A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 2 & k \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -5 \\end{bmatrix} \\]\nhas no inverse.",
