    "text": "Which of the following sets are subspaces of \\(R^3\\)\n\\[ U = \\{(x, y, x - y) \\mid x, y \\text{ are real numbers}\\}; \\quad V = \\{(x, y, xy) \\mid x, y \\text{ are real numbers}\\} \\]",
