    "text": "Suppose that the set of vectors \\(\\{X_1, X_2, X_3\\}\\) is orthonormal. Which of the following set of vectors are also orthonormal?\n(i) \\(\\{X_1, X_2 + X_3\\}\\)\n(ii) \\(\\{X_1, \\frac{1}{2}(X_2 + X_3)\\}\\)\n(iii) \\(\\{X_1, \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(X_2 + X_3)\\}\\)",
