    "quizId": 618,
    "text": "Express the limit\n\\[\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\sum_{i=1}^n x_i (1 + \\sin x_i) \\Delta x\\]\nas a definite integral on the interval \\([0, \\pi]\\).\n\n(i) \\(\\int_0^\\pi x \\, dx\\)\n(ii) \\(\\int_1^\\pi x(1 + \\sin x) \\, dx\\)\n(iii) \\(\\int_0^\\pi x(1 + \\sin x) \\, dx\\)\n(iv) \\(\\int_0^\\pi x \\sin x \\, dx\\)",
