    "explanation": "Đặt \\(f(x) = x^3 - 3x + 1\\). Đạo hàm: \\(f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3\\).\n\nCông thức Newton: \\(x_{n+1} = x_n - \\frac{f(x_n)}{f'(x_n)}\\).\n\nBước 1: với \\(x_1 = 2\\):\n\n\\(f(2) = 2^3 - 3(2) + 1 = 8 - 6 + 1 = 3\\).\n\n\\(f'(2) = 3(2^2) - 3 = 12 - 3 = 9\\).\n\n\\(x_2 = 2 - \\frac{3}{9} = 2 - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{3} \\approx 1.6667\\).\n\nBước 2: với \\(x_2 = 5/3\\):\n\n\\(f(5/3) = (5/3)^3 - 3(5/3) + 1 = \\frac{125}{27} - 5 + 1 = \\frac{125}{27} - 4 = \\frac{17}{27}\\).\n\n\\(f'(5/3) = 3(5/3)^2 - 3 = 3\\left(\\frac{25}{9}\\right) - 3 = \\frac{25}{3} - 3 = \\frac{16}{3}\\).\n\n\\(x_3 = \\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{17/27}{16/3} = \\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{17}{144} = \\frac{240 - 17}{144} = \\frac{223}{144} \\approx 1.54861 \\approx 1.5486\\).\n\nChọn đáp án C (1.5486)."
