    "text": "Given \\(f(x) = \\begin{cases} x + 1, & x < 0 \\\\ \\cos\\pi x, & x \\ge 0 \\end{cases}\\). Calculate \\(\\int_{-1}^1 f(x)\\,dx\\).",
