    "text": "Determine which improper integrals are convergent\n(i) \\(\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{dx}{x^2 + 2}\\)\n(ii) \\(\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{x \\, dx}{x^2 + 2}\\)",
