    "text": "Use Newton's method with the specified initial approximation \\(X_1\\) to find the third approximation \\(X_3\\) to the root of the given equation. \\[X^3 + X + 3 = 0, \\quad X_1 = -1.\\] (Given your answer to 4 decimal places)",
